_pdbx_deposit_group.group_id G_1002338
_pdbx_deposit_group.group_title
'PanDDA analysis group deposition of SARS-CoV-2 Nsp1 soaked with fragments from the F2X-Entry library'
_pdbx_deposit_group.group_description
;SARS-CoV-2 Nsp1 soaked with Fragments from the F2X-Entry library. Includes refined models for hit compounds with ligands placed into the PanDDA event-map, which is the primary evidence for ligand placement. The event-, average and Z-maps and the 2Fo-Fc and Fo-Fc maps are included in the mmcif file. 2Fo-Fc and Fo-Fc maps are not useful to consider as evidence for ligand placement.
;
_pdbx_deposit_group.group_type 'ground state'

